# Shell scripts run on Linux — the VM and the CI runner both. A CRLF checkout
# on Windows produces `\r` line endings that /bin/sh reports as
# "bad interpreter" or silently appends to the last argument of every line, and
# deploy/oci/*.sh is copied to the VM verbatim. The Dockerfile already strips
# them from docker-entrypoint.sh defensively; this stops them existing.
*.sh text eol=lf
